<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Baroda To Dahod Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does it cost to move a single cupboard from Baroda to Dahod?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost depends on the cupboard’s dimensions, weight, and any special handling required. Shree Ashirwad calculates a base freight charge, a volume‑based fee, fuel surcharge, and optional insurance. Typically, prices range between INR 4,500 – ₹7,200, inclusive of GST and e‑Way bill fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my cupboard fully insured during the Baroda‑to‑Dahod transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value marine transit insurance approved by IRDAI. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage throughout the 850 km journey, and a copy of the insurance certificate is provided with the delivery receipt.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for moving household items like a cupboard between Baroda and Dahod?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the GST‑compliant invoice for the move, the e‑Way bill generated by Shree Ashirwad, and a signed packing list. For corporate or government reimbursements, additional clearance forms may be required, all of which are handled by our team.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long will it take for my cupboard to reach Dahod after pickup in Baroda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, the dedicated container truck completes the Baroda‑to‑Dahod leg in 14‑16 hours. Real‑time GPS tracking allows you to monitor progress, and any unforeseen delays at checkposts are communicated promptly to ensure timely delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I request additional protective measures for a fragile antique cupboard?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our 7‑layer packaging system can be upgraded with custom wooden crating, extra foam padding, and climate‑controlled containers if needed. These enhancements are quoted separately and ensure maximum protection for valuable or delicate items.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer same‑day pickup for a cupboard moving from Baroda to Dahod?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Same‑day pickup is available for bookings made before 10 AM, subject to truck availability on the Baroda‑to‑Dahod route. The request can be placed instantly via our online estimate tool, and the confirmed slot will be communicated within an hour.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad’s movers in Baroda and Dahod stand out from other local house movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our team combines IBA approval, ISO 9001:2015 quality management, a 4.9/5 Google rating, and a fleet of GPS‑tracked, specialized container trucks. This blend of regulatory compliance, proven customer satisfaction, and advanced logistics ensures a reliable, transparent, and safe cupboard move.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
